and the Philadelphia Eagles.

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:37.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
It is --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:39.506 size:84% position:42%
And it's perfect timing
for the Eagles' fans

00:00:39.506 --> 00:00:41.941 align:start size:94% position:6%
