from the Super Bowl.

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:46.146 line:92%
-So that is -- That's very nice.

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:47.447 line:92%
It's fun having football on NBC.

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:48.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can tell
the game was on NBC,

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:51.051 size:78% position:39%
