they just heard this.

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:55.355 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ "Law &amp; Order" chime ]

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:57.824 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.824 --> 00:01:00.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
Of course, fantasy football
also began tonight.

00:01:00.527 --> 00:01:03.430
It's a fun way for people
who are bad at real sports

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:06.766
