00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:35.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my gosh.
-It's just really great.

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:38.765
Speaking of the President,
after one of his staffers

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:41.034 align:start size:94% position:6%
wrote an anonymous op-ed
criticizing him,

00:01:41.034 --> 00:01:43.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump is trying to find out
who it was.

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:45.004 align:start size:94% position:6%
Today he said,
"It's kind of fun.

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:48.341
It's like I'm playing a real
life version of 'Blue's Clues.'

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:51.644
We are looking for anonymous.
We are looking for anonymous.

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:55.482
We are looking for anonymous.
Tell me who he is or she."

00:01:55.482 --> 00:02:00.487 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:02.922 line:92%
"Blue, where are you, Blue?"

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:04.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
A lot of people
are trying to figure out

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:05.525 size:81% position:41% line:92%
