00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:11.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have a computer
that can track these things.

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:12.232 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah. For instance,

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:15.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
