"our shared values."

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:17.871 line:92%
Computer Accuspeech 3000,

00:02:17.871 --> 00:02:20.206 align:start size:94% position:6%
has anyone at the White House
ever said that?

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.909 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Our shared values.
Our shared values.

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:25.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
Shared values.
Our shared values.

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:27.180 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:29.182 size:81% position:41%
