00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:30.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
But still it could be anyone.
Okay?

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:34.387
Another phrase they used was
"safer and more prosperous."

00:02:34.387 --> 00:02:36.256 line:92%
Let's see if anyone said that.

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:37.824 line:92%
-Safer and more prosperous.

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:39.259 line:92%
Safer and more prosperous.

00:02:39.259 --> 00:02:40.760 line:92%
And safer and more prosperous.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, okay, okay, okay,
okay, okay, okay.

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:43.863 line:92%
Those are pretty common sayings.

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:46.733
It doesn't mean that he --
it was definitely Mike pence.

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:48.902 size:88% position:44%
There was one article --
one word in the article

00:02:48.902 --> 00:02:51.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
