00:03:04.551 --> 00:03:06.319 size:88% position:44% line:92%
It will be our lodestar.

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:07.120 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
As our lodestar.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:07.554 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Lodestar.

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:09.589
-Okay. It was Mike Pence.
All right, that's fine.

00:03:09.589 --> 00:03:12.592 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let's just move on.
